<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A leader writes an entry to its own disk and then loses contact with its followers. The bytes exist, but the client still needs to know whether the group committed the operation.</p>

<!-- @before Internal Mechanics :: animation -->
### Local persistence is not group commit

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="One copy versus a current-term majority">
